  "description": "Welcome to HackEra 2.0, Erazone's student hackathon designed to turn your ideas into real impact. Build something extraordinary, collaborate with peers, and compete for 10k prizepool. Endless Innovation. Endless Possibilities Guidelines: Eligibility: Open exclusively and completely free of cost to all current students. Format: Online software development hackathon requiring a working prototype, a presentation, and code submission. Team Composition: Teams must consist of 2 to 6 members. Both inter-college and inter-specialization team configurations are fully allowed and encouraged. Problem Statement: Solve India's growing problems by leveraging modern tech stacks, including Web Development, Web3, App dev , SaaS, AI/ML, Blockchain, etc. (Open Innovation). Click here to join the WhatsApp group: https://chat.whatsapp.com/DMTl9jaFDAfBfi3K9iUIUM?s=cl&p=a&mlu=4&ilr=4 Rules: Every participant must be an actively enrolled student. All project builds must correspond directly to one of the provided problem statements. Final submissions are strictly required to include three elements: a Git repository link, a presentation (PPT), and a prototype demonstration video. To qualify for the additional Social Media Engagement prize, teams must publicly share their project, properly tag Erazone, and generate measurable engagement. Evaluation and results will be done on Unstop",
