    "details": "<p>Welcome to HackEra 2.0, Erazone's student hackathon designed to turn your ideas into real impact. Build something extraordinary, collaborate with peers, and compete for 10k prizepool.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Endless Innovation. Endless Possibilities</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Eligibility: Open exclusively and completely free of cost to all current students.</li>\n<li>Format: Online software development hackathon requiring a working prototype, a presentation, and code submission.</li>\n<li>Team Composition: Teams must consist of 2 to 6 members. Both inter-college and inter-specialization team configurations are fully allowed and encouraged.</li>\n<li>Problem Statement: Solve India's growing problems by leveraging modern tech stacks, including Web Development, Web3, App dev , SaaS, AI/ML, &nbsp;Blockchain, etc. (Open Innovation).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Click here to join the WhatsApp group: </strong><a title=\"Link\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/DMTl9jaFDAfBfi3K9iUIUM?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;mlu=4&amp;ilr=4https://chat.whatsapp.com/DMTl9jaFDAfBfi3K9iUIUM?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;mlu=4&amp;ilr=4\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/DMTl9jaFDAfBfi3K9iUIUM?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;mlu=4&amp;ilr=4</a></p>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Every participant must be an actively enrolled student.</li>\n<li>All project builds must correspond directly to one of the provided problem statements.</li>\n<li>Final submissions are strictly required to include three elements: a Git repository link, a presentation (PPT), and a prototype demonstration video.</li>\n<li>To qualify for the additional Social Media Engagement prize, teams must publicly share their project, properly tag Erazone, and generate measurable engagement.</li>\n<li>Evaluation and results will be done on Unstop</li>\n</ul>",
